quickertype-core

quicktype's quicktype-core API with a WebAssembly engine compiled from a Rust
port of quicktype (https://github.com/EloB/quickertype).

The JavaScript in dist/ is compiled from quicktype's
packages/quicktype-core/src (https://github.com/glideapps/quicktype), at the
commit in src/native/UPSTREAM.json of the repository, unmodified except
Run.ts, plus this package's src/native. quicktype is
Copyright (c) 2017-present Glide Apps and the quicktype contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The WebAssembly engine (dist/native/wasm) is compiled from the Rust port in
https://github.com/EloB/quickertype, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, like quicktype.
